	"data": "Meets\n\nStage 5 — Seye, in the workshop, finding Aki\n\nAki was rearranging the crystals.\n\nOf course Aki was rearranging the crystals. The fog had swallowed the dome, the protection spells had failed, the world outside was a cathedral of amplified nothing, and Aki was in the workshop rearranging crystals by color, by frequency, by the way they caught light that wasn't coming from any source Seye could identify.\n\n\"You're here,\" Aki said, without turning around.\n\n\"I'm here,\" Seye confirmed, and was…",
